Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.64,0:02:29.48,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,0)\pos(192,815)}Episode 18: The Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, if you'd be so kind\Nas to sign this document,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything will be squared away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm the kind of guy who'd\Ndo almost anything for a pretty girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even by a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, aren't you sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel about the two\Nof us having dinner sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt when you're\Nobviously so busy, but... Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:02:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to mess with the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard it is\Nto make it look this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as if anybody cares about your hairdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Au River, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get why we're\Nriding in such a fancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expensive car in this sandy death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better for us to\Nget an off-road vehicle instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a method to my madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C 'est magnifique!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys seeing what I am here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like every house is a\Ncrazy mansion or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Tokyo, a house like one of these\Nwould cost 3 or 4 billion yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, for most people in this\Ncountry, it's standard living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't but 20 years ago that\Nthis place was a barren desert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though thanks to a thriving oil industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's grown into a playground for the rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is merciless, but at\Nleast with air conditioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's perfectly comfortable inside the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no complaints here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about\Nhow open it is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we could spot anyone following us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just can't shake the feeling that\Nthere's someone out there watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, can't say that I blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, back to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've given a bit of thought\Nto the route we should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 100 kilometers northwest\Nis a village called Yarplein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The desert and mountains make taking\Na direct route near impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It normally takes two\Ndays to reach my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So to expedite the travel time, the\Nlocals use a Cessna to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should go to the\Nvillage and buy a Cessna
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to cross the\Nvast Saudi Arabian desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I've been apprehensive\Nabout getting anywhere near a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a stand user attacked\Nand the plane went down,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd be putting innocent\Nlives in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we had a Cessna,\NI could be the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be able to save a\Ncouple of days for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying in a Cessna with a man\Nwho's been in three plane crashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that seems like\Na perfect idea to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That comment notwithstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our priority should be\Ncrossing the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hightailing it to\Nthe village of Yarpline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take us one day on Camelback.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Camelback?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Cessna is one thing, but on Camelback?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never ridden a camel in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know these creatures well, and\NI'll teach you how to ride them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys sit back and\Nwatch the magic happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want camels, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure I have them, but\Nthey're gonna cost you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friend, and they need a gentle touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're kind of in a life-or-death situation\Nhere, so we need them, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for payment, how about\Na trade for that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly accept such a\Ngenerous offer! Yeah, Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, you literally\Njust bought that car!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other reason did you think I had\Nto buy such a fancy, expensive car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true an off-road vehicle\Nwould perform better here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're not in the big city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just write a check in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And cash isn't accepted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my experience, trading is far more\Neffective in places such as these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try to buy safety for\Ncheap in a time of emergency,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll find yourself even\Nworse off in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't know about you, but\NI think we've suffered enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it this seals the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make things a little more even, I'd\Nlike the water in those tanks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the most important thing\Nwhen you're in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the water isn't nearly\Nas valuable as your car, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are very strange indeed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossing the desert will be no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, how the heck are we supposed\Nto get on one of these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like three meters tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to demonstrate the\Nproper way to mount a camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to make them sit\Nfirst and then you get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, make them\Nsit and then get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make them sit, and\Nthen you get on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any second this beast is gonna\Nsit, then let me saddle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sit down, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you star! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe Star, you have ridden one\Nof these before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have you know that\NI've watched Lawrence
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Arabia three times\Nnow from start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all too well how to ride a camel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although two of those times\NI slept through half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You learned to ride from a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you've never\Nactually ridden one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The saliva makes great\Nsunscreen, the more you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're handling an animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's absolutely imperative to\Nunderstand exactly how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I mean exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, doesn't this yummy apple\Nlook absolutely scrumptious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the camel sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you just take the time to get inside\Nits head, it'll sit down for you for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's so high off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, did you know camels?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can close their nostrils to keep\Nthe sand out and before I forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're forbidden from\Nmaking Stupid camel jokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your turn now, you greenhorns!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to learn the finer\Npoints Of riding a camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first thing you need to know is that\Ncamels don't walk anything Like horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The front and back legs on either\Nside move forward together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so these things can sway a Lot\Nbut don't let that throw you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you find a way to ride with a camel's\Nrhythm, I know you'll Be just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me! Damn it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you to go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then now that everyone's gotten the hang\Nof mounting and riding their camels!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a desert to get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has arrived! Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onward toward the northwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, wait just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't been able to shake the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feeling that someone out\Nthere is watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, don't you think you\Nmight be worrying a bit too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean the palm leaves\Nwill erase our tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, we can see for\Nkilometers in all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone were here, we'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think he's on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel some sort of presence, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, why don't you go take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything suspicious out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's hurry up and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get as far away as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll keep pressing forward until\Nthe sun goes down this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then stop to pitch our tents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.31,0:11:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much too dangerous\Nfor us to travel at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.15,0:11:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only wish we could get\Nout of this freaking heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's reading 50 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is hot out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, the weather is\Nat its hottest right around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight o 'clock? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, check your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What time does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ten past eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My watch is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost track of time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my watch, it's past 8 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why isn't the sun setting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thermometer is jumping\Nto 60 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the sun isn't setting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually rising higher in the west!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.39,0:12:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, could it be that\Nthat sun is really...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand?
