Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how such\Na thing is even possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this sun actually be a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly, take cover behind those rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell could that sun be a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're such fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did we miss this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that we were being watched,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never thought this is\Nwhy I couldn't see our stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, that sauna's\Ngonna burn all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nom de dieu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to roast us like a\Nbunch of rotisserie chickens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're totally screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I doubt it'll take that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, a sauna can dangerously\Nraise the body's temperature in minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then how do we fight it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C 'est des conneries!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 70 degrees Celsius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.49,0:13:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to add insult to injury, we can't\Ntell if the stand is close or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The distance is impossible to judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only option here is to\Nquickly take out the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have a way to conceal himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And somehow he's been\Nfollowing us all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if it's like the lovers\Nwe encountered in Pakistan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this guy has a stand\Nhe can use from far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not the case this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, a weak STAN can be\Ncontrolled from a distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this sun is just too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The energy it's emitting is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The STAN user has to be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The camels are starting to\Ncollapse from exposure to the heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this wading isn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my Hierophant\Nto look around the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin! I'm only searching\Nfor the stand's rough location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we know how far away it actually is,\Nwe might just be able to locate the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 meters, 40 meters, 60\Nmeters, 80 meters, 100!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, have Hierophant come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something coming right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before that happens, Emeralds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't go in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bust a hole in the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone get in now! Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of\Ninitiating my Emerald Splash,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that protected me\Nfrom any major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More concerning is this intense heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's going to drive me insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did any of you notice that\Nattack was perfectly aimed at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that could only mean that\Nthe enemy has been watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from where? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep shouting,\Nthe enemy will find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just lay low for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll sit tight for a while\Nand see what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things can't go on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, think! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for this old timer\Nto take the bull by the horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this isn't the most ideal spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even use my best technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I get more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you watching us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you invisible or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, you coward! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control yourself, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is happening to you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polarib! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've all lost it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This damn heat has driven\Nthem all completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my sanity, but what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, get a hold of yourself, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.47,0:18:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to listen to me, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes things get rough, but when\Nthey do, you have to remain in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please don't get the\Nwrong idea about this, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look at that rock over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's large enough for someone\Nto hide behind, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I don't follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh you will now take a look at the rock\Nthat's sitting on the opposite side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Opposite side huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um you still don't see it sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have another look. There's\Na rock that's exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same way but it's\Non the opposite side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shadow is also reversed which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a stupid trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you go out there now, you're all\Nbut asking for the enemy to attack you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.47,0:20:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd a hole suddenly appear in thin air?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just assume that the intense\Nheat was too much for you or
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else I'd find it very hard to\Nbelieve that you're my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we defeated the enemy stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.31,0:20:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night's finally fallen or maybe I\Nshould say it's back to being night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you want to slice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're safe at last. Just how long\Ndo you plan on hiding in that hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally gotten dark around here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the little car\Nhe's got behind the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's rather comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's even air conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no clue he was\Nreflecting the desert and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tailing us from behind him\Nthis nifty little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was smarter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see he has a tank of water, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we take it off his hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and here's a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me understand all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, we've already\Ndefeated the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even know this guy's name!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.99,0:21:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow we've already\Nmade short work of his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've hit the nail on the head.
