Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this was the sun card stand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first he was pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once we figured the guy out, he\Nactually kind of sucked, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, off to our next destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty chilly in the\Ndesert at night, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traveling at night is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're not careful,\Nwe could lose our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and with that idiot out of the\Nway, it'll be sweet dreams tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
